# Never commit game files or binaries — this project stores only files we create.
# Game executables, assets, and archives
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
*.bik
*.pak
*.wad
*.megatexture
*.vt
*.streamdb
*.resources
*.tga
*.dds
*.bimage
*.md6
*.bmodel
*.lwo
*.mtr
# Extracted or dumped memory / process data
*.dmp
*.dump
*.raw
# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# ...but recon evidence tables are DERIVED DATA, not run logs. `*.log` above silently
# blocked `recon/2026-09-01-shader-reflection/mvp_offsets.log` for two days: a session
# copied it in believing it was rescued, git never took it, and it stayed a single-disk
# file. Negate the rule for recon/ so evidence cannot be lost that way again.
!dev-archive/recon/**/*.log
!recon/**/*.log
